Phase 9 / M10.5 — diagnostics export + report-a-problem — E2E proof
Date: 2026-09-12  Commit: c7695dc

Proven through a REAL store (durable settings/session/task/events):
1. collect(): report.json carries version/os/arch, real task+event counts,
   the last durable events with REDACTED payloads, os fields asserted.
2. report_a_problem(): PROBLEM.md carries the caller description AND the
   bundle sha256 (matches the SHA256SUMS sidecar).
3. SECURITY PROPERTY: a planted key-shaped secret ("sk-PLANTED-SECRET-
   VALUE") in BOTH the app_settings document and an event payload appears
   in NO bundle file, while "[REDACTED]" proves the settings were exported
   and scrubbed — the bundle is safe to attach to an issue.
4. CLI: `modbit diagnostics --db <p> --out <d>` and `modbit report
   "<description>" --db <p> --out <d>` work directly against the local
   store (no daemon), emitting the bundle path + sha256 as JSON.

